** vem de on-caso-3J_dura_orient.inp (gen_dura_ortho_orient.py). Linear elastic
** ortotropico em sistema cilindrico (1=radial, 2=circ, 3=axial).
*ELASTIC, TYPE=ENGINEERING CONSTANTS
** E_r,    E_theta, E_z,     nu_rt, nu_rz, nu_tz, G_rt,    G_rz
3.000e+6, 9.000e+6, 3.000e+6, 0.30,  0.30,  0.30,  1.150e+6, 1.150e+6
** G_tz, T
1.150e+6, 0.0
*DENSITY
1100
